Inclusion Criteria:

* 1\) Participants who were fully informed about this trial before the experiment, understood the content, process and possible adverse events related to the experimental drug, and voluntarily signed the written informed consent form.
* 2\) Male or female participants aged 18 to 50 years (including the upper and lower limits) at the time of signing the informed consent form.
