* Indication of definitive treatment with chemotherapy and radiation therapy, at the investigator's discretion;
* Performance status \ 60 mL/min (estimate); Bilirubin up to 1.5-fold the upper limit of normal (ULN) and transaminases, alkaline phosphatase and gamma-glutamyltransferase up to 2.5-fold the ULN; Leucocytes \> 3,000/μL; Neutrophils \> 1,500/μL; Hemoglobin \> 10 g/dL; Platelets \> 80,000/μL;
